  "correlation_rules": [
    "ObrasGov geometry can produce spatial proximity to parcel, but distance alone remains contextual.",
    "PNCP object text without geometry/address is TEXT_ONLY and must not be attached to a parcel as confirmed.",
    "Gazette text becomes property-related only through explicit address/public property identifier/legal perimeter/document relation.",
    "Process number may be stored when the process is public and property-relevant; do not ingest unrelated personal documents.",
    "Licensing records should preserve permit/process/document identifiers and source dates."
  ]
